# Dream Seizer {3}{B} 3/2 flying: "When this creature enters, you may blight 1. If you do, each opponent discards a card." To blight 1 is to
# put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control as the ability resolves (CR 701.68a): the only one is the Seizer itself, which becomes a 2/1,
# and Bot2 then discards a card of its choice (CR 701.9), the Memnite. Black Lotus (BBB) and Mox Jet pay the four mana exactly.
# The twin that declines is "...-declined-blights-nothing-and-nobody-discards".

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Dream Seizer
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: B)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dream Seizer.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Dream Seizer)
Bot2.Choose(Memnite)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Seizer.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Seizer.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Dream Seizer.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
